r\\nControlled, steady rhythmic Chinese drumbeat with gentle guzheng rhythm, 保持连续不淡出。\"}},{\"id\":\"7d31794f-6c17-41b7-9e3a-4ac62e6079df\",\"start_frame\":120,\"end_frame\":240,\"color\":\"var(--multitrack-task-bg)\",\"content\":{\"media_type\":\"none\",\"task_mode\":\"ref\",\"continuity_mode\":\"context\",\"ref_image_size\":\"max\",\"images\":[],\"muted\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"user_prompt\":\"无硬切。紧接上一段。\\r\\n[Shot 1] At 00:00.000, steady medium shot. Without jumping, she smoothly shifts her weight into a half-profile stance. The cold blade circles fluidly around her torso in two slow-tempo defensive sweeps. At 00:02.500, camera glides slowly to the left. Driven by a crisp snare hit, her blade arrests abruptly horizontally across her chest, cutting through drifting petals.段末停在横剑当胸、目光如电透过剑脊看向正前方的警戒定格。\\r\\nCANVAS & SPEECH PURITY: 100% clean cinema canvas, zero on-screen subtitles, strictly zero unprompted dialogue, strictly closed-lip silence.\\r\\n整体声景:\\r\\nClean melodic blade whoosh, crisp friction of cloth, dry drum snare click on beat, night ambient breeze.\\r\\n非叙事配乐:\\r\\nSteadily advancing cadence with crisp percussion clicks, 保持连续不淡出。\"}},{\"id\":\"30191720-0958-4e6e-92c3-b5c21b97ce1b\",\"start_frame\":240,\"end_frame\":360,\"color\":\"var(--multitrack-task-bg)\",\"content\":{\"media_type\":\"none\",\"task_mode\":\"ref\",\"continuity_mode\":\"context\",\"ref_image_size\":\"max\",\"images\":[],\"muted\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"user_prompt\":\"无硬切。紧接上一段。\\r\\n[Shot 1] At 00:00.000, medium close-up slow dolly-in. She straightens into an elegant upright posture. Her right hand twirls the sword downwards, locking the cold blade vertically along her right arm and behind her back. At 00:02.500, her left hand draws the sword mudra softly toward her chest, then rests naturally. Floating petals settle gently. 段末停在单手负剑、神态从容凌厉的宗师定格。\\r\\nCANVAS & SPEECH PURITY: 100% clean cinema canvas, zero on-screen subtitles, strictly zero unprompted dialogue, strictly closed-lip s